{"name": "Kings of Cratia", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/bd292f4204892a9b3771f0c2f9d02d69.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"614\"/></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/8973a86795b3e0800542bd734c75288f.poster.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/8973a86795b3e0800542bd734c75288f.webm?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/8973a86795b3e0800542bd734c75288f.mp4?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span>Kings of Cratia offers an experience that mixes real-time strategy and first-person shooter mechanics. Build your new village and manage your resources efficiently. Watch out for changing weather conditions. Be ready to defend your villages every day when night falls! RTS or FPS, you are free to protect your village the way you want it. You can also command your troops in FPS mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/28417887456fbef9472276c9e3e6d657.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"614\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/eab408bbb1c2966d395092b5e973d995.poster.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/eab408bbb1c2966d395092b5e973d995.webm?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/eab408bbb1c2966d395092b5e973d995.mp4?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every day at night, your village will be attacked by invaders. The number of attacking invaders increases with each new night. Develop new tactics against different types of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/715def5ed58c7d5bfbed40d65e35ffa8.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"614\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/805d9b6ead66bcfae10a2579c2f36c3e.poster.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/805d9b6ead66bcfae10a2579c2f36c3e.webm?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/805d9b6ead66bcfae10a2579c2f36c3e.mp4?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each time you survive an invasion, you will be allowed to draw new cards. Choose one of the cards that you draw to get new power-ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/4a315504fc7219beb71cffc1fed70d32.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"614\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/dd69d815156a8e7c4602b6d383cf2b0d.poster.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/dd69d815156a8e7c4602b6d383cf2b0d.webm?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/dd69d815156a8e7c4602b6d383cf2b0d.mp4?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can unlock new special abilities by unlocking knowledge. You can use these special abilities in both modes, RTS and FPS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"64\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/5a406f60bd14f766f2212ff32b9cb948.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"614\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/168238dfa418d983d98ab0f26470648b.poster.avif?t=1756680831\" width=\"620\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/168238dfa418d983d98ab0f26470648b.webm?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/extras/168238dfa418d983d98ab0f26470648b.mp4?t=1756680831\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage your resources carefully and efficiently. Be careful of the changing weather conditions. Get ready to defend your village every night!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game was created mostly by one person. Please feel free to share your thoughts.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Kings of Cratia offers an experience that mixes real-time strategy and first-person shooter mechanics. Build your new village and manage your resources efficiently. Be ready to defend your village every day when night falls! RTS or FPS, you are free to protect your village any way you want it.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594980/c80877d1a9c3afa2e864703cf81b7c3908479026/header.jpg?t=1756680831", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "City Builder", "Tower Defense", "RTS", "FPS", "Medieval"], "developers": "eniscoskun", "publishers": "eniscoskun", "release_date": "Aug 8, 2025", "price": "$4.99", "appid": "3594980", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "9 June 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/RWgLvYeYA6I", "first_seen": 1749427200.0, "review_rank": 1587}